  "label": "The woman in the bathtub is mapped as the 'person' referenced in the text.",
  "description": "The text 'did you know. if you hold a person underwater long enough they stop being an asshole' explicitly refers to a 'person'. The visual material shows a woman in a bathtub, who is the only person depicted. The meme uses this visual to represent the 'person' in the text, creating an analogical mapping where the woman is the subject of the metaphorical statement. The woman's relaxed or unconscious state in the bathtub visually reinforces the absurdity of the text's claim that submersion underwater can change someone's behavior.",
